{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10138260","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10138260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1013826001:3":{"text":"저희를 가엾게 여기셔서 구원의 힘을 주신 듀라 님께 감사드립니다...","source_cn":"感谢艾雅的悲悯，将拯救的力量送到我们身边……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x137369ECB056FB6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013826002:1":{"text":"모두 크게 다치지 않으셔서 다행입니다.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，你们没有受重伤就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E53B619C1466AC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013826003:2":{"text":"하지만... 저희는 듀라 님의 은혜를 저버리고 성석을 지키지 못했어요!","source_cn":"但是……我们辜负了艾雅的恩泽，没能守护好圣石！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC052D0DC7FC3DFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013826004:1":{"text":"세상에 하나 뿐인 성석이 깨졌으니... 이를 어쩌면 좋을까요?","source_cn":"世界上仅有一块的圣石破碎了……这该怎么办才好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x648D2EC2AD7248F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013826005:2":{"text":"...크흠.","source_cn":"……咳咳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B0FE12F86BE5D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1013826005":{"text":"...크흠.","source_cn":"……咳咳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B0FE12F86BE5D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013826006:1":{"text":"다시 한번 여러분의 도움에 감사드립니다. 성기사 테미히아, 앞으로의 계획에 대해 당신과 이야기를 나누어 봐야 할 것 같군요.","source_cn":"再次感谢诸位的相助。圣骑士特弥希娅，我需要和您谈谈接下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3513458066A4054A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013826007:1":{"text":"아, 물론입니다. 루시우스, 너도 함께 가자.","source_cn":"啊，这是当然的。卢修斯，你也一起来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72FA0DF3DD3D9768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013826008:1":{"text":"지금의 상황에 대해... 최대한 빨리 성당에 보고를 할 필요가 있을 것 같아요...","source_cn":"关于目前的情况……有必要快些向圣堂报告——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66DF5F13C3A203B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013826009:1":{"text":"맞습니다. 최대한 빨리 이 일에 대해 보고해야죠!","source_cn":"没错，必须尽快向上汇报这里的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FFD2EB8C3099EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013826010:1":{"text":"이쪽에도 균열을 지켜볼 사람을 남겨 변고가 생기지 않도록 해야 합니다.","source_cn":"你也要留下一部分人看守裂隙，免得事情生变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B8DADCCEC7D2EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013826011:1":{"text":"루시우스, 너 먼저 성석 마을로 돌아가서 이 일을 보고하도록 해.","source_cn":"卢修斯，稍后你先行返回圣石镇汇报此事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x100FEF1FDE58671F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1013826012:2":{"text":"알겠습니다, 대장!","source_cn":"队长，遵命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA935660E3A0E0655","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6FCAFD420F69F57","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... ","female":"... ","variant_male_record_index":"270750","variant_female_record_index":"270751","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"안타깝네","source_cn":"真是可惜","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEB046EA7524F9399","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"안타깝네","female":"안타깝네","variant_male_record_index":"62146","variant_female_record_index":"62147","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:受伤的高阶修女":{"text":"부상 당한 고위 수녀","source":"受伤的高阶修女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","sta